Watch how the AssemblyStation Assembles the Parts Delivered by the Worker
Run the simulation and watch how the AssemblyStation sequentially assembles the parts, which the
Worker delivers
• First, the Sources produce four red, green, and yellow parts
• Then, the Worker steps onto the Workplace attached to the Store picks up a red part, and turns around.
He then walks to the Workplace attached to the AssemblyStation and places the red part onto the pallet.
He then walks back to the Store and picks up the parts in the sequence, which we entered into the
Assembly Table and places the parts onto the pallet.
To follow the assembly process step-by-step, open the Event Debugger.
