Set How Workers Deliver Parts
Set How Workers Deliver Mounting Parts
You can set in the AssemblyStation how Workers will deliver the mounting parts that are to be assembled.
• To make several Workers deliver a part in parallel each, leave the check box Workers Sequentially
Deliver MUs to Assemble cleared.
• To make a single Worker deliver the parts sequentially one after the other, select Workers Sequentially
Deliver MUs to Assemble.
In our examples we will:
• Make Several Workers Deliver Parts in Parallel
• Make a Single Worker Deliver Several Parts at Once
Back to Assemble Parts with the AssemblyStation
